{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 34, :comments ["Their dough — from בצק, as in כסף כספו." "Their kneading bowls — this is the vessel in which one puts the dough, and this is proven by ״ברוך טנאך ומשארתך״. Just as the טנא is the basket in which one puts the fruit, so משארותם is a vessel in which one puts the dough. And this is the meaning of the blessings of the vessels — that they be full of fruits and dough."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:41:15.866263948Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}